{
  "_help": [
    "Beards and mustaches: grey 64x64 skin overlays, tinted in game with the hair colour. One texture per style, named by \"name\".",
    "face: rows at the bottom of the face (8x8 square at 8,8), so the eye rows stay free; chest: rows from the top of the body front (20,20).",
    "In a row every character is one pixel: \".\" is transparent, a digit 2-6 is a shade of grey (digit * 25 + 35, darker to lighter).",
    "face_alpha: opacity of the face rows (default 255).",
    "jaw: also shade the sides of the face and the underside of the jaw (head bottom face) with a fixed pattern."
  ],
